From: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/sun4i: dw-hdmi: survive a deferred bind

With the driver built in, the display engine can bind before the
hdmi-connector bridge has registered. dw_hdmi_bind() then returns
-EPROBE_DEFER, but by that time sun8i_hdmi_phy_init() has already
devm-registered "hdmi-phy-clk" on the PHY device, which stays bound.
The error path never deinits the PHY, and the next bind attempt fails
with -EEXIST when registering the clock again:

  sun8i-hdmi-phy 1ef0000.hdmi-phy: error -17: failed to register clk 'hdmi-phy-clk'
  sun8i-dw-hdmi 1ee0000.hdmi: probe with driver sun8i-dw-hdmi failed with error -17

Register the PHY clock only once and undo sun8i_hdmi_phy_init() on the
bind error path, mirroring sun8i_dw_hdmi_unbind().

Signed-off-by: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_dw_hdmi.c  |  1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c | 18 +++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_dw_hdmi.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_dw_hdmi.c
@@ -205,6 +205,7 @@
 
 cleanup_encoder:
 	drm_encoder_cleanup(encoder);
+	sun8i_hdmi_phy_deinit(hdmi->phy);
 err_disable_clk_tmds:
 	clk_disable_unprepare(hdmi->clk_tmds);
 err_assert_ctrl_reset:
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c
@@ -538,11 +538,19 @@
 	}
 
 	if (phy->variant->has_phy_clk) {
-		ret = sun8i_phy_clk_create(phy, phy->dev,
-					   phy->variant->has_second_pll);
-		if (ret) {
-			dev_err(phy->dev, "Couldn't create the PHY clock\n");
-			goto err_disable_clk_mod;
+		/*
+		 * The clock is devm-registered on the PHY device, which outlives
+		 * HDMI bind/unbind cycles (a deferred bind included), so only
+		 * register it once.
+		 */
+		if (IS_ERR_OR_NULL(phy->clk_phy)) {
+			ret = sun8i_phy_clk_create(phy, phy->dev,
+						   phy->variant->has_second_pll);
+			if (ret) {
+				phy->clk_phy = NULL;
+				dev_err(phy->dev, "Couldn't create the PHY clock\n");
+				goto err_disable_clk_mod;
+			}
 		}
 
 		clk_prepare_enable(phy->clk_phy);
